    "metadata": {
      "title": "Claude Formal Verification: What 255 Reveals About Code Guarantees｜CC Subtitles",
      "description": "Why does a program with only 8 bytes of capacity accept length 255?\nFor anyone who wants to understand AI-written code proofs or asks AI to edit code: we keep reproducible records of accepting valid inputs and of whether execution ends.\n\nWe make the requirements explicit, then fix two real C examples and check their results.\n\nOn 2026-10-22, Anthropic and Theorem published joint research. The study reports 239 entry points across 123 libraries; the public release cited here contains 60 entry points across 25 libraries. The statement that no halts proof is provided applies only to that public release, not to the entire study.\n\nOur original local guard has n=0..255 and a capacity of 8 bytes, with 1 of those bytes reserved for the terminator. It only decides acceptance. A separate, independent program checks the return after counting. Methods: actual C execution, exhaustive enumeration, propositional SAT for the guard, and a finite control graph for the loop. We did not run the vendor's Rocq checker.\n\nOriginal C code, execution results, and the complete source bundle: https://github.com/x812033727/travel_scanner/tree/9c65d31a80ac9622676db460c9ed3d52716b6496/docs/videos/claude-formal-verification-255/data\nThe original SVG diagrams were redrawn for this video from program results and the official workflow. They are not presented as product UI footage.\n\n📌 Chapters\n00:00 Local check accepts 255\n00:24 Record the valid lengths\n01:50 Keep 256; reject the input\n03:37 Reject-all rejects valid input\n04:40 A cycle in the return check\n06:45 Match formal proof conditions\n09:08 Record your own requirements\n\n📚 Sources\nAnthropic：Claude形式驗證研究: https://www.anthropic.com/research/formal-verification\nTheorem公開proof：README: https://github.com/theorem-labs/oss-verify-proofs/blob/main/README.md\nTheorem：證明來源與固定命題: https://github.com/theorem-labs/oss-verify-proofs/blob/main/docs/origin.md\nTheorem：實際checker流程: https://github.com/theorem-labs/oss-verify-proofs/blob/main/docs/checking.md\nTheorem：agreement與halts命題: https://github.com/theorem-labs/oss-verify-proofs/blob/main/docs/statements.md\nC11委員會草案：整數提升與無號轉型: https://www.open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg14/www/docs/n1570.pdf\n\n📷 Image credits\nMokaair原創概念圖1 (原創；保留權利)\nMokaair原創概念圖2 (原創；保留權利)\nMokaair原創概念圖3 (原創；保留權利)\nMokaair原創概念圖4 (原創；保留權利)\nMokaair原創概念圖5 (原創；保留權利)\nMokaair原創概念圖6 (原創；保留權利)\nMokaair原創專用縮圖：接受判斷 (原創；保留權利)\nMokaair原創C：guard.c (原創；保留權利)\nMokaair原創C：loop.c (原創；保留權利)\nMokaair原創專用縮圖SVG (原創；保留權利)\n\n#Claude #formalverification #AI新聞拆解"
    },
